  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>《Legs and Arms》Minecraft 殭屍模組包（適用版本 1.20）</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=http://rocketnode.com/BrCam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/pH6Rk</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/98c5844f62962ec3b5a6e6560e15e3d9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"968\" height=\"244\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特色內容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>（整合生物清單收錄於劇透區塊）</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>阻塞者</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>潛伏者</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>獵殺者</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>月華花</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>喘息者</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>孕殭屍</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>巨型吸噬者</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>吸噬者</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>畢迪</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>爆破者</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>長桿殭屍</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>噴吐者</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>幽影</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>狼殭屍（0.3版）</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><u>熊殭屍（0.3版）</u></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>穢物殭屍（0.2版）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>狂怒殭屍（0.4版）</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- 將模組內所有殭屍材質重製為《TZP》風格</p><p>- 無需額外模組（僅需搭配《不死族重製模組》）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u>推薦搭配：</u></p><p><u>建議與《Tissou's 殭屍材質包》共同使用：</u></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-20</a></strong></u></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrokencamerastuds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><u><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/479710/description_9b1bd023-0d20-4571-a75f-16ca1efc9b7d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"199\"></strong></u></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
